(7, NULL, 'CHURCH MONITORING SYSTEM FOR INTENTIONAL DISCIPLESHIP IN BICOL WITH BIOMETRICS ATTENDANCE INTEGRATION', 'The Church Monitoring System for Intentional Discipleship in Bicol with Biometrics Attendance Integration was developed to address challenges faced by church administrators in tracking attendance, monitoring discipleship progress, and managing church activities manually. Manual processes often lead to delayed reporting, errors in attendance logs, and inefficiencies in communication among church staff and members. The system provides a unified, digital platform that enables administrators and leaders to record, monitor, and evaluate attendance and discipleship activities efficiently. Developed using XP Methodology, the system incorporates features such as biometric attendance verification, role-based access control, request management for church activities, automated notifications, and comprehensive reporting. The system underwent rigorous Unit Testing, Usability Testing, User Acceptance Testing, and Security Testing to ensure functionality, reliability, and security. Results indicate that the system effectively streamlines administrative processes, enhances accuracy in tracking attendance and discipleship activities, and improves overall church management. From the perspective of church operations, the system is a fast, secure, and fully digitalized tool that supports intentional discipleship and administrative efficiency for churches in the Bicol region.', 'Abegail S. Belza, Donna Mae P. Cuarteros, Sybil E. Dasmariñas', '[-0.4399372637271881, 0.5483002662658691, -4.004749298095703, -0.9373114109039308, -0.38004231452941895, -0.7404075860977173, 1.6852880716323853, -0.04367668926715851, 0.3519023358821869, -0.028538912534713745, -1.0544462203979492, -0.3312767744064331, 1.5154081583023071, 0.9806569814682008, -0.35347723960876465, -0.4936533272266388, -0.13921575248241425, -0.733808159828186, -0.7052294015884399, 0.7176604270935059, 0.04991958662867546