(8, NULL, 'K-NECT: A Youth Governance System for Iriga City', 'The study developed K-NECT: A Youth Governance System for Iriga City to address inefficiencies in the manual operations of the Sangguniang Kabataan (SK) and Katipunan ng Kabataan (KK) in Iriga City. Traditional processes involving paper-based profiling, attendance tracking, and event coordination hindered transparency and efficiency. Guided by the Agile Software Development Model, the researchers designed and implemented a six-module web-based system integrating Profiling, Event Scheduling, Attendance Monitoring using RFID, Document Management, Community Bulletin, and Analytics. The system aims to streamline youth governance operations through automation, secure data management, and real-time communication. Evaluation results confirmed the system’s effectiveness and readiness for deployment. Unit Testing achieved a functionality score of 0.99, indicating reliable module performance; User Acceptance Testing yielded a score of 0.99, reflecting high satisfaction among KK, SK, and Pederasyon stakeholders; and Security Testing attained a perfect 1.0, confirming the strength of its authentication and data protection measures. The system’s deployment in the Panlungsod na Pederasyon ng mga Sangguniang Kabataan Office successfully transitioned their operations from manual to digital processes. The study concludes that K-NECT effectively improves profiling accuracy, automates attendance monitoring, enhances communication, and improves document management security. It demonstrates how digital solutions can foster transparency, accountability, and efficiency in youth governance. The researchers recommend future enhancements such as multi-factor authentication, a mobile companion app, and expanded system integration to support broader LGU use. In summary, K-NECT represents a significant step toward modern, technology-driven youth governance in local communities.', 'Dominic B. Bayos, Jon Mare Edric P. Lontayao, Christian Nico B. Luzano', '[-0.5704072713851929, 1.142620325088501, -3.5460872650146484, -0.9964576959609984, 0.49622488021850586, -0.08105610311031342, 0.4633749127388001, 0.21154755353927612, 0.6893993616104126, 0.0006160438060760498, -0.35765838623046875, -0.766581654548645, 1.7261621952056885, 0.8665939569473267, -0.12345273792743684, -0.5324479937553406, -0.31983211636543274, 0.23825271427631375, -0.7729555368423462, 0.8312726020812988, 0.5500093698501587, -0.4358070492744446, -0.5652396082878113, -0.2790180444717407, 2.064135789871216, 0.7083539962768555, 0.2885727286338806, -0.8906536102294922, -0.16798153519630432, -0.4950118362903595, 0.6930643320083618, -1.0638433694839478, 0.32935792207717896, -0.13069184124469757, -0.22428014874458313, -0.4244085550308227, 0.6804694533348083, 0.003359111025929451, 0.27797096967697144, -0.5647494792938232, 0.04945943504571915, 0.25230470299720764, -0.7629132270812988, -0.7953210473060608, -0.374058336019516, 0.07784160226583481, 1.8876421451568604, -0.026704706251621246, 1.2936042547225952, -0.12350292503833772, -0.28720802068710327, -1.3357985019683838, 0.35108861327171326, 0.2537938952445984, 0.4752159118652344, 0.08830622583627701, -0.6147385835647583, 0.6013936996459961, -0.5779726505279541, -1.156330108642578, 2.333348274230957, 1.1650118827819824, -1.634967803955078, 0.6223206520080566, 0.16341912746429443, -0.8564844131469727, -0.015805993229150772, 0.15446782112121582, 0.5668345093727112, -0.18359912931919095, -0.3950301110744476, 0.04172689840197563, -0.07770739495754242, 0.1918114572763443, 0.19907264411449432, -0.22681573033332825, -0.9109625816345216, -0.8390836119651794, -0.8843540549278259, 1.0993809700012207, 0.5390355587005615, -0.15197888016700745, 1.772322654724121, 1.4077318906784058, 0.7069858312606812, -0.3661242723464966, 0.09532591700553894, -0.1386568397283554, -0.7791134715080261, 1.5614147186279297, 0.9777337908744812, 0.212226539850235, 1.0904221534729004, -0.1746307760477066, -1.0318987369537354, 1.