(19, NULL, 'ELEVATEGS: A PROGRESSIVE WEB APPLICATION LEARNING MANAGEMENT SYSTEM FOR GRADUATE SCHOOL OF USANT', 'This study developed ElevateGS a Progressive Web Application (PWA) Learning Management System, to address critical operational inefficiencies at the University of Saint Anthony (USANT) Graduate School, specifically the heavy reliance on manual grading, decentralized announcement channels, and scattered course management that complicates resource retrieval. Utilizing the Adapted Agile Scrum Framework, the system features a decoupled architecture with a PHP Laravel backend and Vue.js frontend, incorporating Service Workers and IndexedDB to enable offline synchronization and centralize academic materials. A mixed-method evaluation involving 60 respondents including faculty, students, and IT experts revealed that the system is \"Highly Functional\" (composite mean of 0.99), with a 100% success rate for offline capabilities. Usability was rated as \"High\" (weighted mean of 3.82) and user satisfaction as \"Good\" (System Usability Scale score of 78.76), confirming that ElevateGS successfully bridges the gap between fragmented, manual processes and digital demands by providing a centralized, and offline- capable platform for the graduate school.', 'Kristhan B. Aguilar, Lenard Anthony A. Gaa, Lyle Mathew S. Ramales', '[-0.7594906687736511, 1.2925238609313965, -3.684946060180664, -0.8879190683364868, 0.11935533583164216, 0.09860356897115707, 0.4586178660392761, 0.2403486520051956, 0.9337851405143738, 0.3833969235420227, 0.28480836749076843, -0.28676697611808777, 1.871048092842102, 0.5097456574440002, 0.012238997966051102, -0.8631662130355835, 0.1546449065208435, -0.10732473433017732, -1.1518877744674685, 0.2343177795410156, 1.0657250881195068, -1.34913170337677, -0.191311776638031, -0.6285645365715027, 1.598388910293579, 0.9835085868835448, -0.5528038144111633, -0.07795988768339157, -0.4565746784210205, -0.33864232897758484, 0.4478907585144043, -1.0853703022003174