(24, NULL, 'IBARYO: GOVERNANCE AUTOMATED AND KPI MONITORING SYSTEM FOR PALOYON ORIENTAL, NABUA, CAMARINES SUR', 'This study developed iBaryo, a web-based governance system designed to help Barangay Paloyon Oriental manage tasks and services more efficiently. Before the system, the barangay relied on manual paperwork that caused delays, missing records, and difficulty in tracking responsibilities and officials’ performance. With iBaryo, barangay operations are centralized in one platform, including role-based task assignments, online document requests, complaint submissions, event scheduling, census records, real-time notifications, and analytics for monitoring performance. It also uses Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) to check how well officials complete their tasks and respond to residents. The system was created using the Agile method and tested for functionality, usability, efficiency, and security, and results showed that it works well, is easy to use, fast, and secure. Overall, iBaryo makes barangay management more organized, transparent, and convenient for both officials and residents, while reducing paperwork and improving accountability. Future upgrades may include national database integration, predictive features, and a mobile app for better accessibility.', 'Roland Joseph P. Cordez, Rayven Fran M. Toralde, Judah Paulo L. Viñas', '[-0.644156277179718, 1.4343724250793457, -3.5660719871520996, -0.37189924716949463, 0.8200098872184753, -0.9117653965950012, -0.17153461277484894, -0.5528758764266968, 0.6188340783119202, 0.2756333351135254, 0.7947922945022583, -0.5681185126304626, 1.998855471611023, 0.334913432598114, 0.6737850308418274, -1.3733863830566406, -0.19411902129650116, -0.4655568301677704, -0.7783845663070679, 0.906979501247406, -0.07281725108623505, 0.3244945704936981, -0.9741963148117064, -0.07919636368751526, 2.980477809906006, 1.002490758895874, 0.32453683018684387, -0.780205249786377, 0.7771952748298645, -0.5345778465270996, 0.2742803692817688, 