(33, NULL, 'A CONVERSATIONAL AI FRAMEWORK FOR AUTOMATING SCHOOL REGISTRAR FUNCTIONS', 'The study, A Conversational AI Framework for Automating School Registrar Functions, aimed to automate and streamline the enrollment and document request processes of Don Gregorio O. Balatan Institute Inc. The traditional manual procedures caused delays, inaccuracies, and inefficiency in record handling. To address these issues, the researchers developed a web-based system integrated with an AI-powered chatbot to handle student inquiries, online enrollment, and document requests in real-time. After the development of the system, the quality was asserted using the ISO 9126 software quality model, focusing on functionality, reliability, usability, and efficiency. Functionality testing yielded an arithmetic mean of 0.99 (99%), reliability testing achieved 0.89 (89%) mean, usability evaluation recorded 0.98 (98%), and performance testing demonstrated 0% error rate across load scenarios from 50 to 340 concurrent users, with response times under 2 seconds. The findings indicate that all proposed modules are working and the functions, processes, and services in the system reliably delivers its purpose. It is also stated that the system is user friendly and usable while having an excellent performance even on high loads of user requests and traffic. In conclusion, the developed Conversational AI Framework provided a modern, reliable, and user-friendly solution for automating key school registrar tasks. It demonstrated the potential of AI to enhance institutional productivity, transparency, and digital transformation. It is recommended that the institution adopt the system to replace manual procedures and consider future enhancements such as mobile application integration, multilingual chatbot features, and expanded AI capabilities for academic advising and record analytics to further improve administrative efficiency and user experience.', 'Glenn P. Lavilla, Keith Marianne L. Olaso, Lee Andrew B. Maniscan', '[-1.2886701822280884, 0.9093118906021118, -3.095787048339844, -1.2470486164093018, 1.1094236373901367, -0.8587168455123901, 1.474684238433838, 0.5384588241577148, 0.08784094452857971, 0.5287574529647827, -1.0459973812103271, -0.4170036315917969, 1.253889799118042, 0.34725767374038696, 0.1099599152803421, -0.9504156112670898, -0.21701550483703613, -0.6644971966743469, -1.4000358581542969, 0.4537662863731384, 0.32420819997787476, 0.07011072337627411, -0.013620011508464811, -0.27243679761886597, 2.0452585220336914, 1.065538763999939, -0.9477109313011168, 0.2235650420188904, -0.9743871688842772, -0.103749617934227, 0.7723945379257202, 0.1982630044221878, 0.25670573115348816, 0.5937703847885132, -0.4354334473609924, -1.0877211093902588, -0.26848021149635315, -0.7221841216087341, 0.00592079758644104, 0.8932583332061768, 0.5379340648651123, 0.07676561921834946, 0.3236793279647827, -0.07682430744171143, 1.1044354438781738, 0.7256724834442139, 0.4607776403427124, -0.24348750710487368, 1.2536370754241943, -1.279301404953003, 0.8708574771881104, -0.7274301648139954, -0.5484902858734131, 0.8513953685760498, 0.7448222637176514, 0.6970108151435852, 0.06947194039821625, 1.536658763885498, -0.49777159094810486, -0.7282778024673462, 2.55857515335083, 1.1716630458831787, -0.40045633912086487, 1.5791184902191162, 0.7016925811767578, -0.13185599446296692, 0.7057626247406006, 0.875529408454895, -0.11279028654098512, -0.10735620558261871, 0.3695094883441925, 0.4835960566997528, 0.11385808885097504, 0.20936769247055056, 0.256541907787323, 0.14454911649227142, -0.908288300037384, -1.5518860816955566, -0.05604417249560356, 0.7041633129119873, 0.04405421763658523, -0.6409106254577637, 1.7892283201217651, 0.11207062005996704, 0.7529909610748291, -0.2495843470096588, 0.12931542098522186, 0.27692198753356934, 0.05113308131694794, 0.7204897403717041, 0.30350008606910706, -0.053934428840875626, 1.0011569261550903, 0.06530113518238068, -1.2735151052474976, 1.4659833908081057, -