ublished'),
(34, NULL, 'DEVELOPMENT OF WEB-BASED ENROLLMENT SYSTEM WITH FACE RECOGNITION FOR RINCONADA NATIONAL TECHNICAL VOCATIONAL SCHOOL', 'This study presents the design and development of a Enrollment System and a facial recognition for attendance intended to enhance attendance and transaction management at RNTVS in Iriga City. The school previously relied on manual processes for recording and managing, which caused delays, attendance inconsistencies, missing records, and difficulty in monitoring the student records. The proposed web-based enrollment system integrates enrollment and student record management along with facial recognition for attendance, real-time grade recording, enrollment monitoring, secure user access, and digitalized data storage. The system was developed using Agile approach which enables iterative development and constant feedback and was evaluated through comprehensive user testing, the system is evaluated based on the ISO 25010 metrics under quality in use model and product quality model, which includes six, namely the Efficiency, Productivity, Satisfaction, Usability, Security, and Compatibility. Results showed that the system significantly improved the speed and accuracy of daily operations, reduced manual workload and enhanced attendance monitoring. It achieved an overall performance rating of 0.98, indicating that it is fully functional, highly usable, and secure for business use. The system provides a reliable technological solution that supports efficient workflow and better decision-making for RNTVS. Future enhancements may include mobile compatibility, automated analytics, and integration.', 'Christian Carl E. Alcantara, Angeline C. Escuro', '[-0.8215810060501099, 0.5907129645347595, -3.803068161010742, -0.2532947063446045, 0.7240744829177856, -0.16486036777496338, 2.141852378845215, 0.0030110739171504974, 0.5763779878616333, 0.1736765205860138, -0.5798759460449219, 0.27736562490463257, 2.1100034713745117, 0.8537589907646179, 0.402741283178