(45, NULL, 'PETKHO PORTAL: SMART VETERINARY CARE AND MONITORING SYSTEM FOR KHO VETERINARY CLINIC RINCONADA', 'The PetKho Portal is a smart online system created to help Kho Veterinary Clinic Rinconada improve its daily work and provide better service to pet owners. The clinic used to rely on handwritten records, walk-in appointments, and manual updates, which often caused delays, missing information, and extra workload for the staff. This project was developed to solve these problems by organizing all important tasks in one easy-to-use platform. The system includes features such as online appointment scheduling, pet record management, inventory tracking, billing and payment recording, referral handling, and automatic notifications. It was developed using the Agile approach, which allowed the team to build the system step by step and improve it based on feedback. Different tests such as performance testing, security testing, use case testing, and user acceptance testing were done to make sure the system works smoothly and safely. The results showed that the PetKho Portal helped reduce errors, save time, and make information easier to access. Pet owners also found it more convenient to book appointments and receive updates. Overall, the PetKho Portal provides a simple, modern, and reliable solution that supports the clinic in giving better and more organized veterinary care.', 'Jey Kyle E. Peregrino, Mary Pons Rica E. Relatores, Anne Psylocke S. Urbina', '[-0.9511052370071412, 0.402246356010437, -3.8821816444396977, -1.1224961280822754, 1.3116276264190674, -0.5579151511192322, -0.6754919290542603, 0.2217991054058075, 0.26727911829948425, -0.5609053373336792, -0.24370187520980835, -0.1725226193666458, 1.8227430582046509, 0.43988943099975586, 0.14496640861034393, -0.4154279828071594, 0.5305535793304443, -0.5231670141220093, -0.27504169940948486, 0.4647853672504425, 0.2587190270423889, 0.013425789773464205, -0.6597497463226318, -0.699608325958252, 1.534046292304993, 0.61