(49, NULL, 'SAFEPASS: RFID-BASED ENTRY AND MONITORING SYSTEM FOR ZEFERINO ARROYO HIGH SCHOOL', 'In this era, ensuring the safety and smooth monitoring inside school grounds has become more important than ever, especially for institutions that still depend on manual entry logs and traditional note sheets. SafePass aims to solve this by introducing a automated RFID-based Entry and Monitoring System designed specifically for Zeferino Arroyo High School. It strengthens school security by accurately recording the entry and exit of students, employees, and visitors, while reducing the human errors that often come with manual recording. SafePass uses RFID technology connected to a centralized web-based platform, allowing real-time monitoring within the campus. Students and employees only need to tap their RFID cards at the gate, and the system instantly captures and records the exact time. The built-in SMS notification feature also sends parents real-time alerts whenever their child enters or leaves the school, giving the families peace of mind. For employees, the system provides an automated Daily Time Record (DTR) with tardiness computation and printable reports to support HR tasks. There’s also a visitor management module with QR code registration to ensure secure and organized documentation of guest entry and exit. Testing indicated that the system performed well in all evaluated areas. Functional testing confirmed that each module works as expected. Integration testing showed smooth coordination among the different system features. Performance tests proved the system stays stable even during busy times, and security testing confirmed that sensitive school data is protected from unauthorized access. SafePass gives Zeferino Arroyo High School a reliable, secure, and efficient way to enhance campus monitoring. By automating entry and exit processes, it helps improve safety, streamline administrative work, and give parents timely updates they can trust.', 'Kristine Joy B. Brazil, Alexa Sophia B. Jacob, Joy Ann Barbie Toldanes', '[-0.18252283334732056, 0.5787094235420227, -3.616806745529175, -0.2712639570236206, 1.0680981874465942, -0.7117081880569458, 1.1814169883728027, 0.8478635549545288, 0.80096834897995, -0.6890134215354919, -0.9936492443084716, 0.04155739024281502, 1.1032860279083252, 0.09576324373483658, 0.5998221635818481, -0.38812512159347534, 0.3643216788768768, -1.117992639541626, -0.3558017611503601, -0.9549503922462464, -0.053847938776016235, -0.09877689927816392, -1.065943956375122, 0.2589988708496094, 2.304830551147461, 0.06645995378494263, 0.6051384210586548, 0.11715610325336456, -0.28504475951194763, -0.1924263834953308, 1.1339133977890017, -0.5097784399986267, -0.7625871896743774, -0.3166566789150238, 0.1169644445180893, -1.5484716892242432, -0.2575124502182007, 0.7544643878936768, -0.7381223440170288, 0.3622083067893982, 1.0961589813232422, 0.45031821727752686, -0.0009653232991695404, -0.6685390472412109, 0.4142336845397949, -0.1918932944536209, 1.4449410438537598, 0.3163091838359833, 1.464091181755066, 0.2106315791606903, -0.2617930471897125, -0.845360517501831, -0.8350880146026611, 1.2877140045166016, 1.0347671508789062, -0.221185564994812, -0.5070699453353882, 0.1550295352935791, -0.8050801753997803, 0.2933889627456665, 2.0290534496307373, 2.228309154510498, -1.1046226024627686, 0.7465750575065613, 0.6504442691802979, 0.23267009854316711, -0.031978484243154526, 0.8018625974655151, 0.2143077850341797, -0.45143038034439087, 0.8366067409515381, 0.11165813356637956, -0.34890779852867126, -0.022973276674747467, 0.4820919632911682, -0.06458068639039993, -0.5492215752601624, -0.0771724134683609, -0.15776050090789795, 1.7305991649627686, 0.10601585358381271, -0.6225159168243408, 0.7518101930618286, 0.17688484489917755, 1.0287050008773804, -0.1105991005897522, -0.3023497760295868, -0.415334552526474, -0.8838015198707581, 1.120882511138916, 0.89642333984375, -0.06770329922437668, 0.2644888162612915, 0.2540128827095032, -0