(74, NULL, 'BoarDal: Web-Based Audal Boarding House Management System with SMS Notification via iTexMo', 'The capstone project, \"Boardal: Web-based Audal Boarding House Management with SMS Notification via iTexMo,\" aimed to modernize and streamline manual processes in boarding house management. Employing the Agile Extreme Programming Development Method, the research focused on developing a dynamic web- based system with SMS notifications for Audal Boarding Houses. Engaging 59 diverse respondents, including owners, tenants, and IT experts, the study identified challenges such as manual payment procedures and data entry errors. The proposed solution, a comprehensive web-based management system, addressed issues like tenant information, room assignments, rent collection, and SMS integration. The system underwent rigorous testing, with User Acceptance and Security Testing resulting in high scores of 0.95 for User Acceptance and 1.0 for Security Testing, affirming its functionality. Notably, the system is accessible on all web-browsing devices. Conclusions highlight the system\'s effectiveness in addressing manual processes, while recommendations include exploring advanced payment options and refining notification capabilities. Future research could delve into analytics for informed decision-making in boarding house operations. Therefore, \"Boardal\" successfully transforms Audal Boarding House management, offering an efficient, functional, and user- friendly solution.', 'Maria Angelica B. Arcilla, Jamil F. Sapnay, Kristine Rose L. Yapan', '[-0.3063511252403259, 1.3316373825073242, -3.362443685531616, -0.0010524485260248184, 0.033106107264757156, -0.6286780834197998, 0.4173973798751831, 0.34986260533332825, 0.6518033146858215, -0.21989908814430237, -0.919510006904602, 0.5023291110992432, 2.3144373893737793, 1.0341825485229492, -0.7163951396942139, -0.9353518486022948, 0.45411548018455505, -0.5073798894882202, -0.024659357964992523, 0.29460394382476807, 0.91490149497985