(78, NULL, 'MEDICARE: A WEB-BASED MEDICAL INVENTORY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM WITH DATA ANALYTICS', 'The healthcare industry relies on effective inventory management to balance patient needs with resource availability. This project aimed to developed Web-Based Medical Inventory Management System for the Medical Mission Group Hospital and Health Services Cooperative of Camarines Sur by automating, optimizing manual processes, and utilizing data analytics. Black box testing and Scrum Methodology were used, and surveys and interviews were conducted with IT experts, supply officers, medical staff, pharmacists, and cashiers. The MediCare system, which includes the Medical Inventory Management System and Patient Data Management System, was developed in collaboration with Team Aries, ensuring efficient hospital operations.', 'Arjay B. Bascon, Ma. Angela Janelle D.P., Jeremy L. Siguenza', '[-0.5739867091178894, 0.842328667640686, -3.305511951446533, -0.48873427510261536, 0.41052111983299255, -0.738264262676239, 0.24982652068138125, -0.41838714480400085, 0.8506712913513184, 0.03276975080370903, 0.4254755675792694, -0.5980815887451172, 2.5504043102264404, 0.06338340789079666, 0.3050445318222046, 0.11491979658603668, -1.1381654739379885, 0.177333265542984, -1.263819694519043, 0.944551169872284, 0.11957552284002304, -1.0046088695526123, -0.9607133865356444, -0.8599895238876343, 1.25018572807312, 0.7425819635391235, 0.2508125305175781, 0.3165987432003021, 0.1323084533214569, 0.05903089791536331, 0.6781938672065735, 0.5187507271766663, 1.063565373420715, -0.1329473853111267, -1.0200961828231812, -1.071470856666565, 0.2349424660205841, -0.057353824377059937, 0.5703057050704956, 1.2458913326263428, 0.14098572731018066, -0.5886014103889465, 0.5477542877197266, -1.4092341661453247, -0.10306314378976822, 0.8477381467819214, 1.0045368671417236, 1.2353044748306274, 0.9111483097076416, 0.3458596467971802, 0.14538484811782837, -0.5559589862823486, -0.5462768077850342, 1.098621129989624, 0.3270836