(80, NULL, 'NICK’S 2BIG: AN ANDROID BASED WATER REFILLING STATION MANAGEMENT APPLICATION', 'In the landscape of water refilling stations, manual transactional challenges hinder efficient operations. To address this, the Android-Based Water Refilling Station Management Application emerges as a revolutionary solution. Tailored for Iriga City, it optimizes water treatment, inventory, and transactions using advanced technology. This comprehensive study navigates through the system lifecycle, encompassing planning, design, and rigorous testing. It explores hardware, software requirements, and scheduling, highlighting technology’s indispensable role in modern convenience. Rigorous testing validated its functional success, specifically in addressing record-keeping and order processing issues. Recommendations for future enhancements, like expanded payment options and improved security, promise sustained adaptability and success for the system in the long run.', 'Kian Kerby Adrisola, Jorel I. Agustin, Ma. Trisha Mae Babia', '[-0.6137062311172485, 1.2070837020874023, -3.1444191932678223, -0.7913217544555664, 0.4285230040550232, -0.3322577476501465, 0.5368125438690186, 0.12009885907173155, 0.4998894333839417, -0.442623496055603, 0.5961827039718628, -0.3559310734272003, 1.4470384120941162, 0.17471712827682495, -0.4254704713821411, -0.7238961458206177, -0.01748592033982277, -0.42668044567108154, -0.18928521871566772, -0.0711524486541748, 0.7067848443984985, -1.241361379623413, -0.4096195697784424, -0.646586537361145, 0.48423585295677185, 0.2087731808423996, 0.38955211639404297, -0.114902563393116, -0.5728360414505005, -0.18961092829704285, 0.7026748657226562, -0.7987053394317627, -1.2114006280899048, -0.5286211371421814, -1.551856517791748, -0.8101877570152283, 0.9023009538650512, -0.3485839068889618, 0.054323744028806686, -0.041563570499420166, 0.3572610914707184, 0.03095296770334244, 0.07229025661945343, -0.7415918111801147, 0.5314136743545532, -0.1742441952228546, 1.152343273