(84, NULL, 'ENHANCED SECURITY: IMPLEMENTING A PASSCODE- PROTECTED DOOR LOCK SYSTEM FOR CCS SERVER ROOM', 'Traditional key-based locking systems present several vulnerabilities, such as key duplication and unauthorized access, which compromise security. This paper introduces an enhanced door lock system utilizing an Arduino microcontroller, fingerprint scanner, membrane keypad, and solenoid lock to address these security concerns. The proposed system ensures high accuracy in fingerprint recognition, robust security, and user-friendly operation. Evaluated using the ISO/IEC 25010 quality model, it demonstrated exceptional performance in functionality, security, and reliability. By integrating modern hardware and software solutions, the system effectively mitigates unauthorized access risks while providing a scalable and efficient security framework. The inclusion of biometric authentication strengthens access control, reducing dependency on physical keys and PIN codes alone. Additionally, this system offers adaptability for various applications, such as residential, commercial, and institutional security, making it a versatile solution for safeguarding sensitive areas. The study underscores the importance of combining cost- effective and advanced technology to establish a secure access management system. With its innovative approach, this project presents a practical alternative to conventional locking mechanisms while maintaining high protection standards.', 'ERYK KYLE JAMES P. FLORES, MICKO S. MENCERO, LIMUEL B. SOLIMAN', '[0.04218388348817825, 0.8473289608955383, -2.6134228706359863, -0.14675796031951904, 0.6596850156784058, -0.6049738526344299, 0.8883630037307739, 1.1526403427124023, 0.23859846591949463, -0.2983199656009674, -0.4562443494796753, 0.07694029808044434, 0.2395496368408203, 0.18069833517074585, 0.5917882919311523, 0.0376066192984581, 0.3642788827419281, -0.23406177759170532, 0.08663865923881531, -0.9727841019630432, 0.04421084746718407, -0.3769220411777