(94, NULL, 'LOCKUP: WEB-BASED MANAGEMENT SYSTEM FOR SMART DOOR LOCK IN MAC LABORATORY', 'The MAC Laboratory currently relies on traditional and conventional locks which can cause serious security concerns within the laboratory premises. To address this issue, the re- searchers aim to develop a web-based management system. The ”LockUp: Web-Based Management System for Smart Door Lock in MAC Laboratory” is a web-based system that utilizes real-time tracking of various essential functionalities within the MAC Lab- oratory such as temperature tracking, on-going course tracking, students and instructors’ management, and various features that aims to streamline and make the day-to-day tasks within the laboratory easier both for the admin as well as the instructors. The researchers conducted various black box testings such as State Transition Testing (Admin and IT Ex- pert), which yielded a result of 0.84 and a functionality level of ”Highly Functional”, Use Case Testing (Admin and IT Expert) with 0.95 results and a functionality level of ”Highly Functional” State Transition Testing (Instructor) with 0.96 with a functionality level of ”Highly Functional”, Use Case Testing (Instructor) with a result of 0.81 and functionality level of ”Highly Functional”, and Integration Testing with a 1.00 result which yielded a level ”Completely Functional”.', 'CHINO LAWRENCE A. NOBLE, HAROLD JAY B. UBANTE, NIKKI COLEEN B. SASALUYA', '[-0.4155273139476776, 0.7612777948379517, -3.590296983718872, 0.06947020441293716, 0.8060225248336792, -0.7382667064666748, 1.1111527681350708, 0.5339187383651733, 0.6251027584075928, -0.5373170375823975, -0.5229791402816772, -0.25408053398132324, 0.6942899227142334, 0.8843212127685547, -0.04987375438213349, -0.1878383904695511, 0.9336757659912108, -0.5674922466278076, 0.006270453333854675, -0.44291138648986816, 0.9283090233802797, -0.6404687166213989, -0.6365733742713928, -0.6295373439788818, 1.397591471672058, 0.5243581533432007, 0.6150113344192505, 0.977945