(99, NULL, 'BIOENTRY: A WEB-BASED DOOR LOCK MANAGEMENT SYSTEM FOR CCS OPEN LABORATORY', 'The Open Laboratory of the College of Computer Studies at Camarines Sur Polytechnic Colleges stills relies on a traditional manual logging. With these, the study focuses on addressing security challenges in the CCS Open Laboratory by proposing a web-based door lock management sys- tem. Named ”BioEntry,” the system integrates advanced technologies such as RFID, pincode, and biometric verification to enhance access control. The project aims to ensure a multi-layered au- thentication process, improving safety and preventing unauthorized access. Key features include real-time monitoring, streamlined user management, and offering an effective and efficient solution for laboratory security. The system is exclusive to CSPC students and staff, with login access re- stricted to CSPC email addresses. Users of this system include admins and instructors. The project emphasizes user-friendly management via a web interface and enhanced scheduling capabilities, ensuring operational efficiency and secure resource access for authorized individuals.', 'ROMEL H. PERALTA, JANE T. SOLERA, ANGELEE S. STO. DOMINGO', '[-0.520639955997467, 0.9794512391090392, -2.93864107131958, -0.03242937847971916, 0.7926058173179626, -0.8306887149810791, 1.3203308582305908, 0.9055498838424684, 0.5843411087989807, -0.5908233523368835, -0.07730886340141296, 0.1181919053196907, 1.276500225067139, -0.12201827764511108, 0.2189006805419922, -0.16593274474143982, 0.3738521635532379, -0.984987199306488, -0.34436336159706116, -0.23411330580711365, 0.49951985478401184, -0.4505678117275238, -0.9272946119308472, 0.1887779086828232, 1.712214469909668, 0.7991936802864075, 1.3393938541412354, 0.47691839933395386, 0.047921713441610336, 0.4162988364696502, 0.6792317032814026, -0.8132109642028809, 0.2889571189880371, -0.304395854473114, -0.4982289671897888, -1.552004337310791, -0.3809366226196289, 0.30767571926116943, -0.52603793144226