(109, NULL, 'SIMPLISAFE: DOOR LOCK MULTI-FACTOR AUTHENTICATION, RFID, PIN WITH FINGERPRINT AT THE CSPC OPEN LABORATORY', 'The CSPC Open Laboratory faced challenges in access control and attendance monitoring due to inefficient traditional methods prone to errors. This study developed the ”Sim- pliSafe: Door Lock Multi-Factor Authentication, RFID, Pin with Fingerprint” system to enhance security and streamline attendance tracking. The primary objective was to address unauthorized access and inefficiencies in manual processes. Agile methodology was used for iterative software development, incorporating user feedback. A mixed-method ap- proach combined quantitative and qualitative research to understand user needs comprehen- sively. Usability testing showed high satisfaction, with an average score of 0.99, indicating ease of navigation. Performance testing achieved a perfect score of 1.00, demonstrating reliability under multiple access requests. Security testing confirmed effectiveness, with an average score of 0.95, ensuring protection of sensitive data. Overall, the SimpliSafe sys- tem significantly improved access control and attendance monitoring, enhancing security, operational efficiency, and user experience at the CSPC Open Laboratory.', 'ABEGAIL C. ALMASCO, SHEILA MARIE P. PABON, JOHN PATRICK T. LACHAMA', '[-0.4465022087097168, 1.0780848264694214, -3.4586262702941895, -0.09660032391548155, 0.8203632831573486, -0.630010724067688, 1.8269355297088623, 1.425950527191162, 0.4400043487548828, -0.1564151793718338, -0.8261795043945312, -0.3003193736076355, 1.0920162200927734, -0.0965968370437622, 0.6619725227355957, -0.21442875266075137, 0.9132992029190063, -0.878311038017273, -0.026132725179195404, -0.5002672076225281, 0.8178551197052002, -0.012680146843194962, -1.5054082870483398, -0.6108291149139404, 2.045050621032715, 0.2727484703063965, 0.9468098282814026, -0.36539483070373535, -0.622665524482727, -0.07974913716316223, 0.027443014085292816, -1.2450823783874512, 0