(129, NULL, 'Geo Spatial Visualization of Flood Hazard Map of Nabua Grocery List Recommendation using Machine Learning Algorithm', 'Flooding raises the danger, infrastructural damage, a rise in wa- Grocery lists are essential when food shopping. But as technology advances, sellers consumers are seeking something that can help in their daily lives. Online Applications are becoming popular these days, in this regard, the researchers aimed to build a model to test and train if K-Nearest Neighbor(KNN) Algorithm is accurate in rec- ommending grocery products. A machine learning approach called KNN (K-Nearest Neighbors) is utilized in recommendation systems. It operates by identifying the k-nearest neighbors (KNN) of a given item and uses their ratings to forecast the value of the target item. Using cosine similarity, a technique for automatically predicting a user\'s interests based on previous preferences, is the major ap- plication for this algorithm. With the help of collecting datasets from different grocery stores and customers, through receipts and questionnaires. Empirical and Constructive research design is used, from data collection to building the model, until testing and train- ing of the model and data collected. Using the cosine similarity, datasets are compared with each other and find the most similar one. The model shows that the model is 62% accurate, which is a good accuracy according to Xiong et al. [2015].', 'John Daryll T. Evangelista, Gerad Niño S. Navida, Shela Mae L. Macasaya, Karla C. Sacueza, Kianna Faye S. Abillonar, Leonard T. Naldo, Mary Cris B. Babasa, Roger C. Ibao Jr, Mark Lawrence C. Del ayre', '[-0.16709072887897491, 0.456035852432251, -3.6613359451293945, -0.4309443533420563, 0.585924506187439, 0.22861292958259585, -0.32451748847961426, 0.24680346250534055, -0.3834819197654724, 0.19833886623382568, 0.426159143447876, 0.7550268173217773, 2.327552080154419, 0.6151426434516907, -0.01903657615184784, 0.07112289220094681, -0.5020729303359985