(136, NULL, 'Tournament Scheduling Using Genetic Algorithm', 'The Tournament Scheduling\'s main task is to generate team sched- uling using a Genetic Algorithm. Offline, the system is a web-based prototype. It runs in the browser and generates a schedule based on the team selected until the best of all teams is determined. The system\'s goal is to make it easy and accurate for each player and committee to reconcile to develop a sense of team in every tournament or sports event. The study will also improve proper evaluation in every game and be smoothly organized to determine the flow and process after the game\'s result.', 'Patricia Ivone Espalmado, Ma. Ellah Sanchez, James Emman Coralde, Ma. Fe Renegado', '[-0.1860751509666443, 1.9278148412704468, -3.718916177749634, -0.13679268956184387, 0.13731905817985535, -0.5342645645141602, 0.4507289230823517, 0.11965171992778778, -1.2124104499816897, 0.3247440457344055, 0.12787260115146637, 1.6041651964187622, 1.9510951042175293, 0.5670884847640991, -0.362158477306366, 0.3900601863861084, -0.4900056421756744, -0.4990224242210388, -0.8963762521743774, 1.03654944896698, 0.01704566925764084, -1.2820680141448977, 0.058982811868190765, 0.414838969707489, 1.677664279937744, -0.2277348190546036, -0.1662251055240631, -0.16032783687114716, -0.22521263360977173, 0.6959872841835022, -0.3813443183898926, -0.07906654477119446, 0.36268749833106995, -0.9363983869552612, 0.2585904598236084, 0.21204528212547305, 0.3703397512435913, -1.4654226303100586, 0.3212383985519409, -0.3011166453361511, -0.3447016179561615, -0.2067306786775589, -0.4507211446762085, -1.009914517402649, 0.4071929156780243, 0.3979179859161377, 1.3368842601776123, 1.0516891479492188, 0.5069167613983154, -1.7299671173095703, 0.2929632067680359, 0.2908226251602173, -0.04438012093305588, -1.3328627347946167, -0.1288623809814453, 1.229288101196289, -0.7945475578308105, 0.373845100402832, 1.7125442028045654, -0.019889164716005325, 1.489757418632507, 2.1169867515563965, -2.01187