(142, NULL, 'OASIS: Image Processing and File Formatting using IS-NET and KENH for Yearbook Layout in Publisher', 'In recent years, the layout of yearbooks had been heavily dependent on manual methods, which has led concerns over the efficiency and creativity of the output. It is difficult for conventional approaches to keep up with the rapid advances in image processing and data management, presenting challenges for yearbook committees aim- ing to produce high-quality and creative yearbooks. This research study aims to address the inefficiencies in manual yearbook lay- out composition, specially the time-consuming and labor-intensive process of making a layout. Existing algorithms like Depth-First Search (DFS) are capable but are inadequate to traverse a large- scale application with large amounts of files due to their limited efficiency. Although image processing and data management have been explored in the past, no comprehensive solution had been proposed for yearbook automation as a software application ex- tension. This study proposed K-dimensional Lead node, Entangled Reference nodes, and Horizontally scaling (KENH) generic tree data structure with KENH Blind Harpoon (KENBH) Searching algorithm. Additionally, an end-to-end data pipeline was designed for data extraction, processing, storage and data injection. The evaluation findings reveal that the KENH used 39.4% more memory than the generic tree data structure. The proposed KENBH searching algo- rithm surpassed the DFS algorithm by 76.95% when comparing the speed performance of the two algorithms. OASIS, the semi- automated software application extension for creating yearbook layout composition and for automatically injecting data, generated 453 of the 500 pages which accounts for 90.6% of the total page in a span of 17 hours. Therefore, this study provides a semi-automated layout composition for yearbook development that enhances the scalability, efficacy, and creativity of yearbook output based on the given results and findings.', 'Ken B. Horlador', '[-0.16297365725040436, 1.065721035003662, -3.2580997943878174, -1.850752353668213, -0.5343486070632935, -1.1694087982177734, 0.06306694447994232, 0.19454866647720337, -0.6489290595054626, -0.297230064868927, 0.6655750274658203, -1.067076325416565, 2.354865074157715, 0.19095510244369507, 0.6884629130363464, 0.040743958204984665, -0.5032416582107544, -0.49065101146698, -0.5841464400291443, 0.582394003868103, 0.2917473614215851, -0.5383951663970947, -0.5493868589401245, -0.32200899720191956, 1.799960017204285, 0.6834943294525146, -0.12474939227104188, -1.1380329132080078, -0.25012263655662537, 0.8793331384658813, 1.6083942651748655, -0.11476187407970428, -0.8886321187019348, -0.3729049861431122, -0.7917479276657104, -1.5047204494476318, 0.8799964189529419, -0.5369372367858887, 0.9195572137832642, 1.0504900217056274, 0.7482402324676514, -0.9249770045280457, -0.0897967740893364, -0.27538326382637024, -0.25119274854660034, -0.5770241618156433, 1.3128522634506226, 0.3886977434158325, 0.6864473819732666, -1.3896472454071045, 0.29413697123527527, 0.14844821393489838, -0.55351322889328, 0.28651106357574463, 0.7771999835968018, 0.3736998438835144, -0.2096492499113083, 0.4861670136451721, 0.8904844522476196, -0.5289067029953003, 1.0426101684570312, 1.2555875778198242, -0.4261908531188965, 1.4300615787506104, 0.5375447869300842, -0.5664675235748291, 0.14823216199874878, 0.703455924987793, 0.17206335067749023, -0.5252470970153809, 0.1954163908958435, -0.13281838595867157, 0.665134608745575, 1.044614553451538, 0.20834550261497495, 0.196072518825531, -0.473982036113739, -0.8782474994659424, -0.790822446346283, 2.014712333679199, 1.0366976261138916, -0.23947060108184817, 1.1795214414596558, 0.11167111992836, 1.173442006111145, -0.033065445721149445, 0.22420558333396912, 0.4259302616119385, 0.020646438002586365, 0.5208573341369629, 0.16633306443691254, -0.11551150679588318, 0.1811651587486267, 0.7373281717300415, -0.7422510385513306, 1.3