(143, NULL, 'TOLL-BASED PARKING LOT DETECTION USING YOLOV9 AND IMAGE THRESHOLDING', 'Urban areas face persistent challenges of traffic congestion, inefficiency in parking management, and economic losses due to the lack of advanced infrastructure. Traditional systems often fail to address the unique vehicle types and patterns in regions like the Philippines, where local vehicles dominate the roads. This introduces a toll-based parking detection system that leverages the YOLOv9 deep learning model combined with image', 'Selwyn Kent B. Oñedo, John Mark A. Pajenago, Arjun Rashid L. Dimanarig', '[0.07374873012304306, 1.0424442291259766, -3.524670124053955, -0.08043842017650604, 1.4193181991577148, 0.1368969976902008, 1.000341296195984, 1.179805040359497, 0.302606999874115, 0.2888476848602295, -0.24183987081050873, -0.4708096385002136, 2.129140853881836, -0.31232672929763794, -0.3351662755012512, -1.177594542503357, -0.6389567852020264, -0.4893900156021118, 1.5531866550445557, -0.017866386100649834, 0.6083035469055176, 0.3483515977859497, -1.659564733505249, -0.3177669942378998, 1.4697693586349487, 0.8035070896148682, 1.0973597764968872, 0.13635092973709106, 0.6238454580307007, 0.07074978202581406, 1.2478432655334473, -1.4667664766311646, -1.3308281898498535, -1.5219446420669556, -1.211604118347168, -0.6209365725517273, 1.726406812667847, -0.16057312488555908, 0.07254008203744888, 0.8859963417053223, 0.4562472403049469, -0.37775087356567383, 0.5811367630958557, -0.6332898736000061, 0.13360488414764404, -1.3735663890838623, 0.809099555015564, 1.107404708862305, 1.717289686203003, 0.7427681684494019, -0.3427218794822693, 0.14147301018238068, -0.9207136034965516, -0.09276457130908966, 0.37020570039749146, 0.0065281689167022705, -0.12564519047737122, 0.46982812881469727, 0.022240784019231796, 0.0020068958401679993, 1.6938409805297852, 2.032640218734741, 0.2816988229751587, 0.7570399641990662, 0.9797859191894532, -0.13847748935222626, 0.3487797975540161, -0.09074265509843826, 