(158, NULL, 'INFORMATION SYSTEM STRATEGIC PLAN FOR BELEN LYING-IN CLINIC MANAGEMENT SYSTEM NABUA, CAMARINES SUR', 'In the ever-changing business environment of today, organizations employ a three-year information system strategic planning process to synchronize their technological and business objectives, offering adaptability while also looking ahead to technology investments, current priorities, and maintaining competitiveness. In this connection, this generally aimed to create the Information System Strategic Plan for Belen Lying-In Clinic Management System Nabua, Camarines Sur. It specifically aimed to assess the current ICT status of Belen Lying-In Clinic; develop an Information System Strategic Plan for Belen Lying-In Clinic; and evaluate the Information System Strategic Plan based on the available ICT resource requirements of the Belen Lying-In Clinic In response to increasing data volume, Belen Lying-In Clinic faces challenges in managing equipment and inventory records. The objective is to enhance operational efficiency, data accuracy, and decision-making. However, financial constraints, technology availability, staff resistance, evolving regulations, and technological advances may limit implementation and long-term success. While the focus is on the Nabua, Camarines Sur branch, the research emphasizes system design over development, documenting details, and implementing a three-year information system plan. Data collection will involve from individuals currently employed at the Belen Lying-In Clinic in Nabua, Camarines Sur. Information will exclusively be gathered from this specific group within the clinic, and the study duration is limited to the next three years.This research utilized the descriptive research design. The respondents were the currently employed at the Belen Lying-In Clinic in Nabua, Camarines Sur. After the collection of the data through interview questionnaire, analysis was done using narrative analysis.', 'HERMOGENES A. HALLARE, JEAN PAULINE S. MABINI, JOHN ARNEL R. REPARIP', '[-0.29809820652008057, 1.0428335666656494, -3.610684394836426, -0.8758367300033569, 0.4078293442726135, -0.15601858496665957, -0.3349703848361969, -0.07278261333703995, 0.990061104297638, 0.24217841029167175, -0.24741727113723755, -0.2764507234096527, 2.2679853439331055, -0.14674833416938782, 0.3825616240501404, -0.6601830720901489, -0.7989928722381592, -0.49776750802993774, -0.42765185236930847, 0.09139912575483322, -0.1282234489917755, -0.693541407585144, -0.9652132987976074, -0.5030784606933594, 1.0722806453704834, 1.404998779296875, 0.20444832742214203, 0.4115513563156128, -0.07730267941951752, -0.7726451754570007, 1.1878790855407717, 0.4765903353691101, 0.306790828704834, -0.7830694913864136, -0.6823931932449341, -1.0585622787475586, -0.4366873502731323, -0.9924196004867554, -0.7705395221710205, 0.3630416989326477, 0.6364887952804565, -1.0823371410369873, -0.8469318151473999, -1.3944087028503418, 0.622341513633728, 0.30873817205429077, 0.17485898733139038, 0.7431429624557495, 0.6964142918586731, -1.1575927734375, 0.5496450662612915, -0.24078883230686188, -0.0931902825832367, 0.37331622838974, 0.8708117008209229, -0.5440629720687866, -0.3111063838005066, 0.8483667969703674, -0.6592737436294556, -1.2212939262390137, 2.1005425453186035, 1.4597808122634888, -0.30740657448768616, 0.7563973665237427, 0.4878149628639221, -1.157909631729126, -0.781896710395813, 1.167622685432434, -0.422548770904541, -1.1173492670059204, 0.47787874937057495, 0.2679198384284973, 0.07808559387922287, -1.0725362300872805, 0.20512615144252777, 0.30182185769081116, -0.6301150918006897, -0.7245904207229614, -0.7185218930244446, 0.9940168857574464, 0.961601197719574, -0.2790294885635376, 1.4896674156188965, 0.25886523723602295, 0.8787479400634766, 0.06072194874286651, 0.3617521524429322, -1.212615728378296, 0.11477192491292952, 1.3910000324249268, -0.2133820652961731, 0.7785627245903015, 0.785481333732605, 0.5827517509460449, -1.7111049890518188, 0.670