(161, NULL, 'LEAN UX IMPLEMENTATION IN THE ANALYSIS AND DESIGN OF INFORMATION SYSTEM FOR CIVIL REGISTRAR OFFICE IN NABUA', 'In today\'s global society, technology plays a vital role in driving progress. The use of Information Systems is essential in our rapidly changing world. This study aims to analyze and propose a Web design of Information System to aid the management of vital documents at the Civil Registrar’s Office in Nabua. Specifically, identify the process and problems encountered in the manual process of the Civil Registrar’s office. Propose Web design of information system using Lean UX framework. Evaluate the proposed design of an information system using Heuristic Evaluation. And determine the level of satisfaction of the users to the proposed Web design of the information system. To address the objectives of the study, the researcher utilized the mixed-method approach, employing both quantitative and qualitative research methods. The respondents of the study are the 15 employees of Civil Registrar’s office, and 5 IT experts serve as a representative of the whole population. Data collection involved observation, interviews, and distribution of survey questionnaires, with analysis using weighted mean calculations. Findings revealed challenges in document storage, organization, retrieval, and security. Implementing Lean UX in the Analysis and Design of Information System the users Agree with the proposed Web design\'s efficacy and receive Satisfied rating across various criteria. The study concludes that the proposed Web design meets user needs, enhancing operational efficiency and satisfaction. Recommendations include using the design as a deployment blueprint, advocating its adoption by the Civil Registrar’s Office in Nabua to alleviate workload burdens and prevent data loss. Additional features, such as mobile-based functionality and robust hardware and database infrastructure, are suggested to further enhance system functionality and resilience.', 'ZYRA B. FLORIANO, ANGELOU C. TORALLO', '[-0.3757455348968506, 1.235398292541504, -2.8505725860595703, -0.8271896839141846, 0.7467741966247559, 0.39230167865753174, 1.1463944911956787, 1.0046401023864746, 0.2349102348089218, -0.013135516084730623, 0.2897135019302368, -0.4741054773330689, 1.2629444599151611, 0.23368209600448608, 0.27871638536453247, 0.6682239174842834, -0.28930628299713135, -0.6531820893287659, -0.20475521683692932, 1.108691930770874, -0.1156480461359024, -0.3814930915832519, -1.3410887718200684, -0.6121471524238586, 1.6331743001937866, 1.1609174013137815, 0.3583142161369324, -0.6262419819831848, -0.7017183303833008, -0.1967172771692276, 0.4397737085819245, 0.2904970049858093, -0.07254013419151306, -0.7001422047615051, -0.5547239780426025, -0.938899040222168, -0.5041515231132507, -0.715197741985321, 0.9595324993133544, 0.24755588173866272, -0.03901689127087593, -1.5092774629592896, -0.43636706471443176, -0.9081714153289796, 0.8414586782455444, 0.03900482505559921, 0.2820303440093994, -0.17909686267375946, 1.3057693243026731, -0.3885402083396912, 0.13807108998298645, -0.6383856534957886, 0.31200388073921204, 0.47611767053604126, 0.5323401093482971, 0.1200396865606308, -0.9131360054016112, 1.1564816236495972, -0.41661280393600464, -1.4534239768981934, 1.5852166414260864, 2.1384520530700684, -0.25823071599006653, 1.608089566230774, -0.03342917934060097, -0.6518756747245789, 0.33761483430862427, 0.392423540353775, 0.0081423819065094, -0.5671560168266296, 0.5807238817214966, 0.7727799415588379, 0.23049837350845337, 0.20506012439727783, 0.18750472366809845, 0.05928734689950943, -0.7906400561332703, -0.83798748254776, -0.26788967847824097, 0.5638444423675537, 0.8399462699890137, -0.7890638113021851, 1.0905470848083496, 0.675861120223999, 1.3064541816711426, 0.786679744720459, -0.6074993014335632, -0.7176066040992737, -0.13671845197677612, 0.5539889335632324, 0.0718560442328453, -0.0631398931145668, 0.5475517511367798, 0.21967017650604248, -1.5729869604110718, 