(163, NULL, 'Utilizing an Enterprise Resource Plan (ERP) Software for the Optimization of Business Process for Beloro Funeral Services', 'As technology emerges, many business industries use different kind of technology and software that can help to optimize their business operations. This study generally aimed to optimize the key business process of Beloro Funeral Services. It specifically aimed to analyze the key business processes and setup an ERP software to enhance Sales, Purchasing, Scheduling, Inventory and Accounting, this process was tested using the ISO 25010 in terms of Functional Suitability, Performance Efficiency, Reliability and Usability. This research employed mixed-method and data collection was conducted through survey questionnaire. The researchers systematically followed the phases of Enterprise Resource Plan (ERP) Life Cycle and Framework. The findings are; Bolero Funeral Services rely on manual work, setting modules such sales, purchasing, inventory, scheduling and accounting enhances business operation. The evaluation suggests that Enterprise Resources Plan (ERP) software was overall evaluated by the respondents with the scale of 4.80; Functional Suitability (4.92); Performance Efficiency (4.76); Reliability (4.81); Interaction Capability (4.8); indicates Highly Acceptable; Odoo software provides automation of the key business processes of Beloro Funeral Services. The Odoo is compatible on setting the modules of Business Process such as sales, inventory, purchasing, accounting and scheduling. Overall rating of highly acceptable in evaluation result. Therefore, the Odoo setup is completely acceptable and significantly enhances the business operations of Beloro Funeral Services. Future researchers should study the long-term effects of ERP implementation, expand their studies to include a larger number of branches, explore how an ERP system can optimize additional business functions, and create a life plan.', 'MARC DARWIN P. BELLEN, JOEBETH R. CUADRO, JONEL C. ESPIRITU', '[-0.28476330637931824, 1.0112475156784058, -2.9155526161193848, -0.7258855104446411, 0.5826556086540222, -0.661820650100708, 0.5963765382766724, 0.23503202199935913, -0.20753997564315796, 0.6164979338645935, -0.4491797685623169, -0.4853766858577728, 2.205091714859009, -0.23099586367607117, 0.4239964485168457, -0.4771446883678436, 0.2051500827074051, -0.7415961027145386, -1.0849368572235107, 0.5876016616821289, 0.4804024398326874, -1.353466510772705, -0.48156335949897766, -0.3839350938796997, 1.699057698249817, 0.9349490404129028, -0.34012091159820557, 0.15131837129592896, -0.3456752300262451, -1.1082850694656372, 0.23740532994270325, 0.695185124874115, 0.7449631690979004, -0.4742579460144043, -0.9608792066574096, -1.8097150325775144, 0.20207500457763672, 0.35740479826927185, 0.4851851761341095, 0.4386264681816101, 0.47725021839141846, -1.4843156337738037, 0.6567181348800659, -0.03996926173567772, 1.1097891330718994, -0.23961783945560455, 1.7725138664245603, 0.7439361810684204, 0.4564265012741089, -0.90666002035141, 0.8949443101882935, -0.7927267551422119, -0.3753642141819, -0.06946567445993423, 0.4722509980201721, -0.5053244233131409, -0.050810642540454865, 1.828073501586914, -0.64798903465271, -1.0827420949935913, 1.836719036102295, 1.6147046089172363, 0.06004326790571213, 0.6203880906105042, 0.6828635334968567, -0.8141165375709534, -0.06753519922494888, 0.15783903002738953, 0.3630906343460083, -0.17662349343299866, 0.4773513972759247, 0.19690102338790896, -1.156131386756897, -0.7437257766723633, -0.10114680230617525, 0.025228092446923256, -1.2024788856506348, -0.5810027718544006, -1.0512019395828247, 1.6811460256576538, 0.9492321610450744, 0.11582252383232115, 0.7149914503097534, 0.7082762122154236, -0.35407447814941406, -0.4279555380344391, 0.7483710646629333, -0.5313435792922974, 0.37680643796920776, 0.5422269105911255, 0.2924913167953491, -0.9491551518440248, 0.7375684976577759, 1.0067914724349976, -1.0593643188476562, 1.4647866487503