(176, NULL, 'IMPLEMENTATION OF ODOO ERP SOLUTIONS FOR M.I.T COMPUTER SERVICES’ MULTIPLE BRANCHES', 'This study, entitled Implementation of Odoo ERP Solutions for M.I.T Computer Services’ Multiple Branches, aimed to design, implement, and evaluate an Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) system to improve the operational efficiency of M.I.T Computer Services, a small-to-medium IT service enterprise operating multiple branches in Camarines Sur. Prior to implementation, the company relied on manual and spreadsheet-based processes for sales, inventory, invoicing, and accounting, which led to data redundancy, operational delays, and increased risk of human error. To address these issues, the study implemented Odoo ERP using a simplified ERP Life Cycle Framework tailored for multi-branch SMEs, integrating key modules such as Point of Sale, Inventory Management, Invoicing, and Accounting into a centralized system. A mixed- method research design was employed, combining interviews and observations with a quantitative evaluation using survey questionnaires administered to IT experts and ERP specialists. The system was evaluated based on ISO/IEC 25010 software quality standards, specifically functional suitability, performance efficiency, reliability, and interaction capability. The results revealed that the implemented Odoo ERP system achieved an overall weighted mean score of 4.59, interpreted as Highly Acceptable. Functional Suitability obtained a weighted mean of 4.53, Performance Efficiency recorded 4.64, Reliability achieved 4.59, and Interaction Capability obtained 4.61, all interpreted as Strongly Agree. These findings indicate that the system effectively supports core business processes, operates efficiently, remains reliable during continuous use, and provides a user-friendly interface. Furthermore, deploying the ERP system across multiple branches enabled centralized data management, improved transaction accuracy, and enhanced managerial decision-making.', 'LANIE M. BUTIAL', '[-0.47601282596588135, 1.2384870052337646, -3.1223528385162354, -1.3895282745361328, 0.9202319383621216, -0.1835612654685974, 0.4134354591369629, -0.2107306271791458, 0.360590934753418, 0.42026829719543457, -0.03836986422538757, -0.060549717396497726, 1.1593143939971924, -0.1108490377664566, 0.5670801401138306, -0.0709727555513382, -0.4193950593471527, -0.6067711114883423, -1.15595805644989, 0.22262009978294373, 0.3058905005455017, -0.7320641279220581, -0.6387820839881897, -0.570651650428772, 2.125900983810425, 0.933683454990387, -0.9158056974411012, -0.291835218667984, -0.775814414024353, -0.9589853882789612, 0.6424449682235718, -0.3973342776298523, 1.0603612661361694, -1.0832711458206177, -1.1521726846694946, -1.0495795011520386, 0.5778043270111084, -0.02587380073964596, 0.786440372467041, 0.3997315764427185, 0.17023365199565887, -0.7648614645004272, 0.5691136121749878, -0.463697612285614, 0.5672682523727417, -0.664132833480835, 1.5128042697906494, 0.8785622715950012, 0.8309181332588196, -0.6593730449676514, 0.9859508275985718, -0.159470334649086, 0.1836528778076172, 1.0180957317352295, 0.30674177408218384, 0.13227076828479767, -0.39504873752593994, 0.8813860416412354, -0.25768131017684937, -1.2089557647705078, 1.0422768592834473, 1.733553409576416, 0.06650522351264954, 0.3964076340198517, 0.5196264982223511, -0.2778802514076233, 0.33159154653549194, 1.1566026210784912, 0.284462034702301, -0.5055405497550964, 0.5618811249732971, -0.3165837526321411, -0.966609537601471, -0.7103638648986816, 0.48956549167633057, -0.17532368004322052, -0.852435827255249, -0.944743514060974, -0.5199331045150757, 1.472515344619751, 0.9769362807273864, 0.21699197590351105, 1.4121589660644531, 0.4779362678527832, 0.5635775327682495, -0.47467297315597534, -0.08480270951986313, -0.9671047925949096, 0.06870050728321075, 0.07941059023141861, -0.32294726371765137, -0.15476812422275543, 0.43654030561447144, 0.7321184873580933, -0.8846076130867004, 0.46063363552093506, -0.2672414183616