(179, NULL, 'DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION OF XPERT MOTORCYCLE SHOPS IN BICOL THROUGH IMPLEMENTATION OF ODOO', 'Many small businesses today still operate on manual processes for their operations, even though digital tools and software that can simplify their tasks are widely available. This study aimed to transform the multiple branches of XPERT Motorcycle Shop from manual to digital through the implementation of Odoo. Specifically, this study aimed to achieve the followings; to examine the existing business process of XPERT Motor Shops, to customize Odoo modules that fits in the business process, to determine the level of acceptability of customized Odoo modules, in terms of; Functional Suitability, Performance Efficiency, Compatibility, and Interaction Capability, and to deploy the ERP System at XPERT Motorcycle Shops multiple branches. The system was evaluated to determine its acceptability using weighted mean. In terms of its acceptability, the overall average of the system was 4.08 resulting that the system is moderately acceptable by the given criteria.', 'NATHANIEL M. AVILES, CHRISTIAN F. SILAVA, ANGELI MAE S. MARASIGAN', '[-0.7411929368972778, 0.8720835447311401, -3.561668872833252, -0.5085608959197998, -0.4019718170166016, -0.6522600054740906, 0.508405327796936, -0.06897109746932983, 0.007417039945721626, -0.4121935367584229, 0.08443044126033783, -0.40737807750701904, 1.4717265367507937, -0.19848191738128665, 0.34770467877388, -0.6468271017074585, 0.04136480391025543, -0.6520998477935791, -0.667809247970581, 0.43530094623565674, 0.4752099812030792, -0.4096328616142273, -0.6282945275306702, -1.3410340547561646, 2.1836442947387695, -0.22356365621089935, -0.5606786012649536, -0.6589362025260925, 0.5729594230651855, 0.1413174271583557, 0.7434211373329163, -0.7940617799758911, 0.6789612770080566, -0.4500739574432373, -0.822981595993042, -1.181776523590088, 1.240153670310974, 0.4689947962760926, 0.8141601085662842, 0.204020157456398, 0.029380112886428833, -1.00020146369