(180, NULL, 'ASSESSMENT OF THE LIBRARY ONLINE PUBLIC ACCESS CATALOG AT CAMARINES SUR POLYTECHNIC COLLEGES', 'This study presented an assessment of the Library Online Public Access Catalog (OPAC) at Camarines Sur Polytechnic Colleges (CSPC). The purpose of the research was to evaluate the efficiency, usability, and overall effectiveness of the OPAC in providing access to library resources for students, faculty, and staff. Specifically, the study examined user satisfaction, ease of navigation, system reliability, and the extent to which the OPAC met the information needs of its users. Data was gathered through surveys, interviews, and system evaluation tools, allowing for both qualitative and quantitative analysis. Findings revealed that while the OPAC served as a vital tool in resource discovery, users encountered challenges related to search functionality, interface design, and system responsiveness. Recommendations focused on system upgrades, user training, and enhanced technical support to improve user experience and maximize the potential of OPAC.', 'JOHN HARVY B. AURELLANO, RICHARD S. ELCANO', '[-1.3221051692962646, 0.5968955159187317, -2.625434637069702, -1.9009376764297483, 1.0144500732421875, -0.18308252096176147, 0.9860494136810304, 0.6663653254508972, 0.36905020475387573, 0.8126637935638428, 0.8832162022590637, -0.7752083539962769, 1.250935673713684, 0.7668245434761047, 1.152104377746582, -0.7570575475692749, -0.345414936542511, -1.1616032123565674, -0.31829437613487244, -0.4060521721839905, 0.4265202283859253, -1.842845678329468, -0.6902306079864502, 0.1695893406867981, 1.017677903175354, 0.8140355348587036, -0.16118288040161133, 0.02899761497974396, -1.458130121231079, 0.05430266261100769, 0.463338166475296, -1.445412516593933, 0.07017141580581665, -0.7507694959640503, -0.6696164011955261, -0.6009646058082581, 1.1591432094573977, 0.3851929306983948, 0.3812756538391114, 1.1197656393051147, -0.6190142631530762, -0.8911439180374146, 0.6489776968955994, -0.66