'BSIT', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published'),
(186, NULL, 'MOVE SMART IRIGA: Building the Smart Front-End of Iriga’s Intelligent Terminal System', 'Nowadays, the existence of technology had significantly transformed the society and organizations by improving operations and information management providing a competitive advantage and supporting growth. In this regard, UI (User Interface) and UX (User Experience) played a vital role in making effective interaction between users and technology as it facilitated easier navigation and enhanced satisfaction. Transportation terminals served as key infrastructure in connecting locations and facilitating the movement of people and goods. Specifically, those that benefited from digital solutions improved their service and user experience. However, Iriga City Central Terminal remained reliant on manual processes resulting in inefficiencies, poor information access, and difficulty in planning for its users. Generally, this study aimed to design and develop a web-based front-end for a smart and intelligent terminal system to address these challenges. The system sought to improve the operational efficiencies, organize management processes, and provide passengers with a more satisfying experience and also enhanced the service quality. This study utilized a combination of mixed- method design and Human-Centered Design Framework. Data were gathered from the terminal end users which includes administrators, vehicle operators, and passengers through interviews and usability evaluations based on Nielsen’s Heuristic Principles and ISO 9241-11 Usability Metrics. Moreover, data were analysed using thematic analysis and arithmetic mean computations. Findings indicated that the designed system achieved a strongly agreeable usability score. As a result, this demonstrated that the designed system had the potential to digitalize terminal operations, improve its coordination among stakeholders, and elevate the overall commuting experience.', 'JOHN PATRICK MAMANO ALFELOR, CECILIO ORDAS DELA RAMA IV, AILA MARIE AMBROSIO ESPERANZA', '[-1.4114000797271729, 1.162506103515625, -3.297635078430176, -0.7324633598327637, 0.7822796106338501, 0.19379493594169617, 0.807966947555542, 0.590362548828125, -0.1996670961380005, -0.2990407645702362, 0.23261353373527527, -1.094074249267578, 1.775282859802246, 0.7287447452545166, 0.66508948802948, -0.9750978350639344, 0.1252208948135376, -0.09564845263957976, 0.2059476226568222, 0.6060324907302856, 1.0942277908325195, -0.9764567613601683, -0.6996469497680664, 0.06103374436497688, 1.2472224235534668, 0.45292890071868896, 0.31314510107040405, 0.388535350561142, 0.081566721200943, -0.4302713871002197, 1.002845048904419, -1.0435807704925537, -0.09527836740016936, -0.29433396458625793, -0.8175746202468872, -0.13798078894615173, 0.748056173324585, -0.23800402879714969, 0.5737597942352295, 0.1177094355225563, 0.1621948778629303, -1.5402114391326904, -0.19591179490089417, -1.3161133527755735, 1.080267310142517, -0.16970863938331604, 0.43870213627815247, -0.4393466711044311, 0.8809819221496582, 0.2568662762641907, 0.04094778746366501, -0.2985759675502777, -0.4923726320266723, -0.07347477972507477, 1.0171037912368774, -0.13622921705245972, -0.1352268010377884, 0.5737672448158264, -0.5210684537887573, -0.8563433289527893, 0.7422452569007874, 1.4413844347000122, 0.13007932901382446, 1.0633251667022705, 0.39906853437423706, -0.1000598445534706, 0.42164522409439087, 1.2894295454025269, -0.5419082641601562, -0.8427404165267944, 0.4772725701332092, -0.4079316258430481, -0.020147889852523804, 0.14891432225704193, 0.6059607267379761, 1.1492350101470947, -0.26844558119773865, -0.578408420085907, -0.3078288435935974, 1.400228500366211, 0.8818684816360474, -1.4341208934783936, 0.8723207116127014, 0.15962862968444824, 0.9148324728012084, 0.01919606328010559, 0.05344667285680771, -0.8307833075523376, -0.11208971589803696, 1.3060178756713867, 0.05257067084312439, 0.003909550607204437, 0.39506661891937256, -0.11551333963871002, -1.642763376235962