(194, NULL, 'ENHANCING BUSINESS EFFICIENCY OF NGO AND SONS TRADING WITH ODOO ERP INTEGRATION', 'Many small and medium-sized businesses (SMEs) still rely on antiquated manual procedures that were once adequate in today\'s business climate. Handwritten inventory logs, paper receipts, and simple spreadsheet programs are examples of traditional methods that frequently slow down operations, raise the possibility of errors, and make it more difficult to react swiftly to customer needs. These outdated systems begin to restrict a company\'s capacity to expand and function effectively as competition increases and demand becomes more complex. this study aimed to enhanced the business efficiency of Ngo & Sons Trading\'s with Odoo. Specifically, this study aimed the followings; to determine the current business process procedures of Ngo and Sons, to customized Odoo ERP system based on the gathered business processes of Ngo and Sons, to assess the Odoo ERP system’s using ISO/IEC 25010 software quality standards, particularly with regard to Functional Suitability, Performance Efficiency, Compatibility, Interaction Capability, Reliability, Security, Maintainability, Flexibility, and Safety, and to deploy the Odoo ERP Software in Ngo and Sons Trading. The system was evaluated to determine its acceptability using weighted mean. In terms of its acceptability, the overall average of the system was 4.16 resulting that the system is moderately acceptable by the given criteria. Manual processes in purchasing, inventory management, sales transactions, accounting, and point-of-sale operations can be effectively automated using Odoo ERP. Automation provided real-time monitoring, minimized errors, and enabled faster and more accurate decision-making. The successful customization and configuration of Odoo ERP software confirmed its capability to meet the operational requirements of Ngo & Sons Trading. The use of Odoo 16 Community Edition proved to be a flexible and scalable solution suitable for SMEs. The ERP system achieved high levels of acceptability across ISO 25010 quality characteristics. Its strong performance in Security, Functional Suitability, and Performance Efficiency validates that Odoo ERP is a reliable and effective solution for streamlining SME operations.', 'GEORGE S. CAÑAVERAL, KARYLLE J. OBRERO, JULIUS S. SECOPITO', '[-0.4109134078025818, 1.4763479232788086, -3.524115085601806, -0.3864010274410248, 0.3587501645088196, -0.42504218220710754, 1.3076624870300293, 0.20350605249404907, 0.3430759906768799, 0.31223180890083313, -0.3147992491722107, -0.19112014770507812, 1.6045570373535156, -0.09667900204658508, 0.8347663879394531, 0.3051470220088959, 0.164497047662735, -0.47729551792144775, -0.9828026294708252, 0.9826833009719848, 0.3534201979637146, -0.1379614621400833, -0.19531205296516416, -1.0501433610916138, 1.9172356128692627, 0.12403151392936708, -0.5170729160308838, -0.6932617425918579, -0.4160786271095276, -1.027149677276611, 0.3137638568878174, -0.2395774722099304, 0.875566840171814, -0.26750412583351135, -0.979161024093628, -0.8030025362968445, 1.1705917119979858, -0.3732522428035736, 0.8681921362876892, -0.14699168503284454, 0.21820414066314697, -0.9169340133666992, 0.27100640535354614, -0.23365482687950137, 0.7191067337989807, 0.05800536274909973, 1.5963985919952393, 0.4175529479980469, 0.8676489591598511, -1.0183310508728027, 0.9213640093803406, -1.2312109470367432, 0.236403226852417, 0.7104663848876953, 1.2357046604156494, -0.36858195066452026, -0.011974046006798744, 1.2868481874465942, -0.1896180957555771, -0.5277003645896912, 0.4799088835716248, 1.2863293886184692, 0.19752776622772217, 0.8113145232200623, 0.9162214398384094, 0.04973095655441284, 0.22515740990638733, 0.49009060859680176, 0.8903632164001465, -0.5081318020820618, 0.42633968591690063, 0.2305331826210022, -0.9567221403121948, -0.9555337429046632, 0.3422336280345917, 0.011963097378611565, -0.7521117925643921, -0.4575818181037903, -0.5940640568733215, 1.757015585899