(5, 'Network Designer/UI Designer', 'ND/UID - Prepares the network and external design of the system in terms that make sense to a person using it: the network plan, the screens and reports, and the navigational map of the system. Coordinates well with the PH/DD.'),
(6, 'Software Engineer/Programmer', 'SE/P - Writes and tests the system. This role is played partly by every member of the team. Communicates well with the ND/UID.'),
(7, 'QA Tester/Documentation Writer', 'QA/TW - Responsible for the documentation side, or manuscript, of the system. Coordinates well with the SE/P.');

